# ================================================== #
# Member API

### 회원가입 이메일 전송
POST {{host}}{{apiPath}}/members/join/send-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gksxorb147@naver.com"
}

### 회원가입
POST {{host}}{{apiPath}}/members/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "홍길동",
  "joinToken": "f0c72f51-8f66-43c6-b225-414e591ad422",
  "email": "gksxorb147@naver.com",
  "nickname": "길동이",
  "password": "mypassword",
  "introduction": "안녕하세요, 저는 개발자입니다."
}

### 로그인 JWT 토큰 발급
POST {{host}}{{apiPath}}/members/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user1@example.com",
  "password": "111"
}

### JWT 토큰 갱신
POST {{host}}{{apiPath}}/members/refresh
Set-Cookie: refreshToken={{accessToken}}; Path=/; Max-Age=604800; Expires=Sat, 02 Nov 2024 14:29:05 GMT; HttpOnly; SameSite=Strict

### 회원 정보 수정
POST {{host}}{{apiPath}}/members/{{memberId}}/edit
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nickname": "닉네임 수정 테스트",
    "username": "수정이",
    "introduction": "수정된 소개글입니다."
}

### 비밀번호 변경 이메일 전송
POST {{host}}{{apiPath}}/members/password-reset/send-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gksxorb147@naver.com"
}

### 비밀번호 변경
POST {{host}}{{apiPath}}/members/password-reset
content-type: application/json

{
  "token": "c99a89e5-c580-4e15-bf76-4f8a57647995",
  "newPassword":"newpassword"

}

### 이메일 조회
POST http://presnt.ggogit.io:8086/api/v1/auth/isMember
Content-Type: application/json

{
"email": "dlgmlrnjs213@gmail.com"
}